This is a SIAAS-Personal-specific port of createResearcher, not an official Morphic API
and not the complete Morphic application. It retains the AI SDK ToolLoopAgent
search/fetch loop and Ollama provider. The UI, database, cloud providers,
tracing, multimodal tools and upstream search/extraction providers are omitted.
SIAAS Personal adds bounded SearXNG search, pinned-DNS public-page reading, authenticated
HTTP transport and a versioned evidence response. The final generated text is
not used as evidence. Instructions are adapted for evidence collection only.
